|---|---|---|---|
| E01 audio tanlash | Transcript ko‘rinmasdan “two books” eshittiring; 1/2/3 kitob rasmlari | 2 kitob | “Avval miqdorni tinglang. Two — ikki.” |
| E02 tartiblash | `pens`, `three` kartalarini joylashtiring | three pens | “Son buyum nomidan oldin keladi.” |
| E03 bo‘sh joy | 2 sumka rasmi, `two ___` | bags | “Bu yerda bitta emas. Bag so‘zining ko‘pligi qanday?” |
| E04 tahrir | `three pen` ni to‘g‘rilang | three pens | “Miqdor to‘g‘ri; otning shaklini tekshiring.” |
